{"unit_id":"zhourenke__dsh-agent-rate-limit#feature-1","repo":"zhourenke/dsh-agent-rate-limit","commit":"d394b7d5600d409ce940613a0935e1b05247f1bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Agent Rate Limit 的功能「滑动窗口速率控制」：在 LLM 请求开始前统计窗口内令牌数和请求数；接近 TPM 或 RPM 上限时等待旧记录过期，有余量则立即继续。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:435-478"]}
{"unit_id":"zhourenke__dsh-agent-rate-limit#feature-2","repo":"zhourenke/dsh-agent-rate-limit","commit":"d394b7d5600d409ce940613a0935e1b05247f1bf","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Agent Rate Limit 的功能「真实用量记账」：读取流中的 usage 数据，将未缓存输入、缓存读写及输出令牌合并后记录到窗口，供后续请求估算额度。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:490-556"]}
